      "text": "Just so you know, final coverage and premiums are subject to medical underwriting and depend on verified medical history. Thanks for letting me know. With four people, we can look at the Family Shield plan, which covers up to four dependent children under 26 and starts at $520 per month for a family of four. Does anyone who would be covered use tobacco?",
